    "updated_at": "2016-08-17T12:09:22Z",
    "body": "That's definitely worth consider, but I suspect the current behavior on `normalize()` may be intentional, if you take it as an invariant that calling `normalize()` shouldn't change what is serialized.\n\nSo assuming that it's already perfectly interoperable I think just spec'ing that would be best.\n",
